<title>BELGIUM: EU molasses import duties remain suspended.</title>
<headline>EU molasses import duties remain suspended.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union import duties on molasses will remain suspended for the coming week, an EU official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The cif reference prices for cane and beet sugar were set at 8.39 Ecus per 100 kg and 12.24 Ecus per 100 kg respectively, compared with 8.35 Ecus and 12.01 Ecus the previous week.</p>
<p>-Brussels Bureau +322 287 6830</p>
</text>
